.pf .fuss { margin-top: 8mm; padding-top: 2mm; border-top: .5pt solid #cbd5e1;
            font-size: 7.5pt; color: #64748b; }
.pf .hinweis { font-size: 8pt; color: #64748b; font-style: italic; }
.pf tr { page-break-inside: avoid; }
"""

